0. Definitions.

 "This License" refers to version 3 of the GNU General Public License.

 "Copyright" also means copyright-like rights such as those accorded
by statue or through contract law.

 "The Program" refers to any copyrightable work licensed under this
License. Each licensee is addressed as "you." "Licensees" and
"recovering licensees" may refer to one or more individuals or
entities.

 "Source code" for a work means the preferred form of the work for
making modifications to it. "Object code" means any non-source form of a work.

 "You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under
this License.

 "This License" refers to version 3 of the GNU General Public License.

1. Source Code.

The developer shall make sure that the users of the program have access
to the source code of the program, which should be published along with
the work or made available for download. The developer may also
provide the users the ability to receive source code by
transferring it through an appropriate medium to the users.

The developer has discretion to provide or withhold access to the
source code under certain circumstances, provided it does not
negatively affect the user's right to access and modify the program.

2. Modification.

You may not modify or distribute any part of the program that is
subject to copyright protection without first obtaining the rights
to do so. In the event that you distribute copies of based on the
program you'll share the same rights with the new users.

3. Distribution.

You may distribute copies of the program under terms of this License,
but you must pass on the same freedoms to all recipients. You must be
aware that you cannot impose any further restrictions on the user's
right to modify or distribute copies.

4. Warranty Disclaimer.

Unless stated otherwise, the program is provided "as is" without any
warranty. The developer  shall not be liable for any damages resulting
from the improper use of the program.

5. Acceptance.

By using the program, you accept its terms. If you do not want to
take part in these terms, you must stop using the program  and destroy
all copies.

